    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "La diferencia no es solo de velocidad. NumPy hace explícita una operación\n",
        "matemática sobre todos los elementos.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Construcción reproducible de ejes\n",
        "\n",
        "Para una señal muestreada con frecuencia \\(f_s\\), el periodo es:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "T_s = \\frac{1}{f_s}.\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Si hay \\(N\\) muestras iniciando en cero:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "t_n = \\frac{n}{f_s}, \\qquad n = 0,1,\\ldots,N-1.\n",
        "$$"
      ],
      "id": "6f38f6a2"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| eval: false\n",
        "sampling_frequency_hz = 250.0\n",
        "duration_s = 4.0\n",
        "n_samples = int(sampling_frequency_hz * duration_s)\n",
        "\n",
        "time_s = np.arange(n_samples, dtype=float) / sampling_frequency_hz"
