        "$$\n",
        "\\sigma^2 = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i-\\bar{x})^2.\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "La varianza muestral insesgada usual divide por \\(N-1\\):\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "s^2 = \\frac{1}{N-1}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i-\\bar{x})^2.\n",
        "$$"
